cfg - read and change system settings

  cfg                    every domain and key
  cfg net                one domain
  cfg set input.keymap be_azerty
  cfg reset input.keymap

Keys are declared by the system; a name it does not know is an error,
not a new setting. Changes reach whoever watches the domain at once.
The store says plainly when the root is memory and a change will not
outlive the boot.
